Package: SCOUTJOY
Title: Significant Cross-trait OUtliers and Trends in JOint York regression
Version: 1.0.2
Authors@R: c(
    person("Amanda", "Elliott", email = "aelliott@broadinstitute.org", role = c("aut")),
    person("Ran", "Cui", role = c("ctb")),
    person("Raymond", "Walters", email = "rwalters@broadinstitute.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description: Compare genetic effect sizes (with standard errors) 
    from two studies to identify regression trend and significant 
    outliers or overdispersion. Allows sample overlap with estimation
    of residual correlation from LD Score regression.
